   "id": "f1_notes",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 60,
   "y": 690,
   "width": 1282.6000000000001,
   "height": 82.5,
   "text": "•  One shared number, private contacts and history per employee (caller matched by verified mobile number)\n•  Speech matching with confirmation and a keypad fallback; every attempt is stored and shown on the call page\n•  Failures are explicit states with Retry and Resync, never silent",
   "originalText": "•  One shared number, private contacts and history per employee (caller matched by verified mobile number)\n•  Speech matching with confirmation and a keypad fallback; every attempt is stored and shown on the call page\n•  Failures are explicit states with Retry and Resync, never silent",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
