   "id": "f2_note_t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2718,
   "y": 795,
   "width": 574,
   "height": 60,
   "text": "Codespaces / local Node.js: same code and schema. One Node process,\nlocal PostgreSQL 16, Next.js after() instead of Queues, no Hyperdrive.\nTwilio needs a public HTTPS URL either way.",
   "originalText": "Codespaces / local Node.js: same code and schema. One Node process,\nlocal PostgreSQL 16, Next.js after() instead of Queues, no Hyperdrive.\nTwilio needs a public HTTPS URL either way.",
