   "id": "f4_rules",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 1760,
   "y": 1710,
   "width": 1520,
   "height": 180
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": "f4",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1478884363,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1985836477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1789585524628,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "id": "f4_rules_t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1790,
   "y": 1728,
   "width": 1287.9,
   "height": 112.5,
   "text": "How it stays reliable\n•  Twilio can send the same callback twice. Each call is stored once, and every callback is kept as raw evidence.\n•  Only one worker can process a call at a time. If it dies mid-way, the job unlocks itself and can be picked up again.\n•  If a callback never arrives, Resync asks Twilio what happened. If transcription or email fails, Retry runs that step again.\n•  Sending an email and recording that it was sent are two separate steps, so a rare duplicate email is possible; a missing one is not.",
   "originalText": "How it stays reliable\n•  Twilio can send the same callback twice. Each call is stored once, and every callback is kept as raw evidence.\n•  Only one worker can process a call at a time. If it dies mid-way, the job unlocks itself and can be picked up again.\n•  If a callback never arrives, Resync asks Twilio what happened. If transcription or email fails, Retry runs that step again.\n•  Sending an email and recording that it was sent are two separate steps, so a rare duplicate email is possible; a missing one is not.",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#bbb",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
