   },
   "seed": 810666126,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1317618240,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1789585524628,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "id": "f6_p0_b",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 1760,
   "y": 2250,
   "width": 490,
   "height": 610
  },
  {
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": "f6",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1824570354,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 184038821,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1789585524628,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "id": "f6_p0_t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1780,
   "y": 2270,
   "width": 441.49,
   "height": 425,
   "text": "•  Twilio Gather + a deterministic matcher:\n    testable, no LLM, cannot be prompt-injected\n\n•  Always confirm before dialing; keypad\n    speed dial is the fallback\n\n•  Batch Deepgram on the dual-channel recording:\n    channel = speaker, no diarization guesswork\n\n•  One Next.js app: web UI, server actions,\n    webhooks, queue consumer\n\n•  Persisted call states + compare-and-set claims\n    survive restarts and duplicate callbacks\n\n•  Call state travels in Twilio-signed URLs;\n    no session table\n\n•  Same code on Node and Workers; after() vs\n    Queues is the only swap",
   "originalText": "•  Twilio Gather + a deterministic matcher:\n    testable, no LLM, cannot be prompt-injected\n\n•  Always confirm before dialing; keypad\n    speed dial is the fallback\n\n•  Batch Deepgram on the dual-channel recording:\n    channel = speaker, no diarization guesswork\n\n•  One Next.js app: web UI, server actions,\n    webhooks, queue consumer\n\n•  Persisted call states + compare-and-set claims\n    survive restarts and duplicate callbacks\n\n•  Call state travels in Twilio-signed URLs;\n    no session table\n\n•  Same code on Node and Workers; after() vs\n    Queues is the only swap",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
