   "seed": 1345869590,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1852821704,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1789585524628,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "id": "f6_p2_t",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2810,
   "y": 2270,
   "width": 414.46000000000004,
   "height": 510,
   "text": "•  Contact import\n\n•  Own recording storage with a retention\n    policy; delete from Twilio afterwards\n\n•  Scheduled sweep for stale and stuck calls\n    instead of manual Retry / Resync\n\n•  Encrypt transcripts and numbers at rest\n\n•  Supabase access control: row-level security\n    and least-privilege database roles\n\n•  Logging, monitoring, and alerts on usage:\n    call volume, provider spend, queue backlog\n\n•  Admin view to manage users, phone numbers,\n    and contacts\n\n•  Optional spoken PIN for callers who need\n    a second factor\n\n•  Multi-tenant: one number per organisation,\n    per-tenant Twilio subaccounts",
   "originalText": "•  Contact import\n\n•  Own recording storage with a retention\n    policy; delete from Twilio afterwards\n\n•  Scheduled sweep for stale and stuck calls\n    instead of manual Retry / Resync\n\n•  Encrypt transcripts and numbers at rest\n\n•  Supabase access control: row-level security\n    and least-privilege database roles\n\n•  Logging, monitoring, and alerts on usage:\n    call volume, provider spend, queue backlog\n\n•  Admin view to manage users, phone numbers,\n    and contacts\n\n•  Optional spoken PIN for callers who need\n    a second factor\n\n•  Multi-tenant: one number per organisation,\n    per-tenant Twilio subaccounts",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  }
